// DNS Query Request By Regsvr32.EXE | T1218.010, T1559.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/dns_query/dns_query_win_regsvr32_dns_query.yml
Image:*\\regsvr32.exe

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "Image:*\\\\regsvr32.exe",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
